A.\ce{Al^{3+}}
B.\ce{Co^{2+}}
C.\ce{Cr^{3+}}
D.\ce{Fe^{3+}}
E.\ce{Mn^{2+}}
F.\ce{Ni^{2+}}
G.\ce{Zn^{2+}}
Select all best-scoring options.
